    "description": "The Deactivate Telecom SIM API enables service providers to effectively manage their telecom SIM lifecycles by deactivating currently active SIM cards. This operation is crucial for ensuring that unused or lost SIMs are promptly deactivated, preventing unauthorized usage and potential fraud. The API primarily serves telecom operators and customer service platforms that require seamless integration for SIM management tasks. Through this API, users can automate processes related to SIM deactivation, enhancing operational efficiency and customer service capabilities.",
